    + '<h3 style="margin-bottom:6px;">⚔️ Battle Arena</h3>'
    + '<p style="color:var(--text-muted);font-size:0.85rem;line-height:1.55;">Your 5 monsters battle another trainer\'s team automatically — sit back and enjoy the show. Matches are friendly: no points are won or lost.</p>'
    + '<div class="tcg-record">'
